erb pass releasing Jude Bellingham, who was fouled by Liam Scales, earning the defender a second yellow card and a dismissal.\nEngland capitalised on the numerical advantage ruthlessly, Anthony Gordon scoring his first England goal two minutes later, pouncing at the far post after the Republic defence failed to clear debutant Tino Livramento's cross.", "reference": "2024 November 17, Phil McNulty, “England 5-0 Republic of Ireland”, in BBC Sport:"}], "synonyms": [], "antonyms": [], "translations": [{"language": {"code": "sq", "name": "Albanian"}, "word": "numerik"}, {"language": {"code": "ar", "name": "Arabic"}, "word": "عَدَدِيّ"}, {"language": {"code": "ar", "name": "Arabic"}, "word": "رَقْمِيّ"}, {"language": {"code": "hy", "name": "Armenian"}, "word": "թվային"}, {"language": {"code": "az", "name": "Azerbaijani"}, "word": "ədədi"}, {"language": {"code": "be", "name": "Belarusian"}, "word": "лі́кавы"}, {"language": {"code": "be", "name": "Belarusian"}, "word": "цыфравы́"}, {"language": {"code": "bg", "name": "Bulgarian"}, "word": "чи́слен"}, {"language": {"code": "bg", "name": "Bulgarian"}, "word": "ци́фров"}, {"language": {"code": "ca", "name": "Catalan"}, "word": "numèric"}, {"language": {"code": "cmn", "name": "Chinese Mandarin"}, "word": "數值的 /数值的"}, {"language": {"code": "cs", "name": "Czech"}, "word": "číselný"}, {"language": {"code": "cs", "name": "Czech"}, "word": "numerický"}, {"language": {"code": "da", "name": "Danish"}, "word": "numerisk"}, {"language": {"code": "nl", "name": "Dutch"}, "word": "numeriek"}, {"language": {"code": "et", "name": "Estonian"}, "word": "arvuline"}, {"language": {"code": "fi", "name": "Finnish"}, "word": "numeerinen"}, {"language": {"code": "fi", "name": "Finnish"}, "word": "lukumääräinen"}, {"language": {"code": "fr", "name": "French"}, "word": "numérique"}, {"language": {"code": "gl", "name": "Galician"}, "word": "numérico"}, {"language": {"code": "ka", "name": "Georgian"}, "word": "რიცხვული"}, {"language": {"code": "ka", "na